  "ch4.model.how": "This is the timeline from model 3, with the screen on variable refresh. Drag the GPU frame rate, choose the screen's refresh range, and switch low framerate compensation (LFC) on or off. See what the screen does when a frame falls inside the range, below it, or above it.",
